N5008 [temp.arg.explicit]/4: a trailing template parameter pack not otherwise
deduced is an empty sequence, so make_box<>() returns box<> and arity is 0.
CBMC drops make_box<>() (empty explicit pack for a variadic function template
with a nested-pack-expansion return type), so the call has no viable function
([temp.deduct]/8).  Surfaced as a CONVERSION ERROR by the SFINAE-enforcement fix
(was previously swallowed silently).  Flip to CORE once resolved.  Non-empty
cases are CORE in cpp11_variadic_member_alias_pack.
